  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7612101",
      "subQuestName": "Meet Columbina",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761210101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761210101": {
            "id": "761210101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "♪~",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210102"
            ]
          },
          "761210102": {
            "id": "761210102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey there, Columbina! You seem to be in a good mood today!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210103"
            ]
          },
          "761210103": {
            "id": "761210103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Hah... Come on up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210104"
            ]
          },
          "761210104": {
            "id": "761210104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You wanna play Moon Chess again or something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210105"
            ]
          },
          "761210105": {
            "id": "761210105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes. It has been a while, and I somewhat miss playing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210106"
            ]
          },
          "761210106": {
            "id": "761210106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are the rules the same as before?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210107"
            ]
          },
          "761210107": {
            "id": "761210107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Or, can you move multiple pieces per turn now because you're the Trilune Goddess?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210108"
            ]
          },
          "761210108": {
            "id": "761210108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "That would be cheating.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210109"
            ]
          },
          "761210109": {
            "id": "761210109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, yeah, Paimon knows that! She was just kidding.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210110"
            ]
          },
          "761210110": {
            "id": "761210110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Shall we begin, then?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7612102",
      "subQuestName": "Play Moon Chess with Columbina",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761210201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761210201": {
            "id": "761210201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "And so, you and Columbina had a wonderful time playing the game together...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210202"
            ]
          },
          "761210202": {
            "id": "761210202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "The three moons, linked up in a line...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210203"
            ]
          },
          "761210203": {
            "id": "761210203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Still thinking about how that last match went?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210204"
            ]
          },
          "761210204": {
            "id": "761210204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Oh, no. It's just... Looking back on the game now gives me a peculiar feeling.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210205"
            ]
          },
          "761210205": {
            "id": "761210205",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, yeah. Now that you have the power of three moons, you've become more than just something that can dominate the night sky.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210206"
            ]
          },
          "761210206": {
            "id": "761210206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes. And I also think... that the fate of the world may have been different, had there not been division between the three Moon Goddesses.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210207"
            ]
          },
          "761210207": {
            "id": "761210207",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What were they like?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210208"
            ]
          },
          "761210208": {
            "id": "761210208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "The first one I saw was Sonnet, goddess of the Iridescent Moon. She was livelier than I'd imagined, more like a playful younger sister.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210209"
            ]
          },
          "761210209": {
            "id": "761210209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Aria of the Eternal Moon, was the most mature of the three. She was a natural leader, and was most gentle to others. Ah, just like Lauma, actually.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210210"
            ]
          },
          "761210210": {
            "id": "761210210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "As for Canon of the Frost Moon... she seemed both wise and far-sighted. And it was she who gave her moon to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210211"
            ]
          },
          "761210211": {
            "id": "761210211",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sounds like all of them were kind deities.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210212"
            ]
          },
          "761210212": {
            "id": "761210212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes. Despite their differences, they loved Teyvat, and they love this home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210213"
            ]
          },
          "761210213": {
            "id": "761210213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "When I spoke to them of the things to come, they all seemed relieved, glad that this world still held so rich a future.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210214"
            ]
          },
          "761210214": {
            "id": "761210214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "That was also why they gave me the power to return \"home.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210215"
            ]
          },
          "761210215": {
            "id": "761210215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh... Paimon would love to see them, and give them a real proper \"thank you\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210216"
            ]
          },
          "761210216": {
            "id": "761210216",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I would very much like that as well. But I fear it's no longer possible...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210217"
            ]
          },
          "761210217": {
            "id": "761210217",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Fortunately, this world continues onward, and the humans they protected have survived, and pass on their stories to this day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210218"
            ]
          },
          "761210218": {
            "id": "761210218",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Exactly! As long as we live well and don't let the bad guys destroy the world — that's the best thanks we can give 'em!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210221"
            ]
          },
          "761210221": {
            "id": "761210221",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Of course! You can bet Paimon's always trying to live her best life!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210222"
            ]
          },
          "761210222": {
            "id": "761210222",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You too, Columbina! Eat well and sleep well every day, and come find us if you wanna play games!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210223"
            ]
          },
          "761210223": {
            "id": "761210223",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Haha, sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761210224"
            ]
          },
          "761210224": {
            "id": "761210224",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I suspect that from now on, I shall think of those three gentle goddesses every time I play Moon Chess..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7605403",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760540301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760540301": {
            "id": "760540301",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Perhaps... Like this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540302"
            ]
          },
          "760540302": {
            "id": "760540302",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Hmm, let me think...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540303"
            ]
          },
          "760540303": {
            "id": "760540303",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Oh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540304"
            ]
          },
          "760540304": {
            "id": "760540304",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Moons... Moons...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540305"
            ]
          },
          "760540305": {
            "id": "760540305",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "How about here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540306"
            ]
          },
          "760540306": {
            "id": "760540306",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Looks like I won this round.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540307"
            ]
          },
          "760540307": {
            "id": "760540307",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "My three moons are connected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540308"
            ]
          },
          "760540308": {
            "id": "760540308",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Mm, this should win it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540309"
            ]
          },
          "760540309": {
            "id": "760540309",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Mm... The moons wax and wane in an endless cycle...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540310"
            ]
          },
          "760540310": {
            "id": "760540310",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "It seems both sets of moons refuse to be eclipsed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540311"
            ]
          },
          "760540311": {
            "id": "760540311",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Are we... heading for a tie?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540312"
            ]
          },
          "760540312": {
            "id": "760540312",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Ah, you weigh your decisions carefully before making them, I see. Take your time — we have plenty of that, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540313"
            ]
          },
          "760540313": {
            "id": "760540313",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Did you forget how to place your moons in the night sky? Shall I help you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540314"
            ]
          },
          "760540314": {
            "id": "760540314",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "You don't like this game? Hm... I find it quite amusing myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540315"
            ]
          },
          "760540315": {
            "id": "760540315",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Mm? Are you staring at me? Your gaze is not subtle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540316"
            ]
          },
          "760540316": {
            "id": "760540316",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "You're staring... Is the truth of the moons written on my face?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540317"
            ]
          },
          "760540317": {
            "id": "760540317",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "The board's over there, by the way...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540318"
            ]
          },
          "760540318": {
            "id": "760540318",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Hm, your moons are aligned.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540319"
            ]
          },
          "760540319": {
            "id": "760540319",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "The night sky is yours.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540320"
            ]
          },
          "760540320": {
            "id": "760540320",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "The Damselette",
            "text": "Ah... I must have... slipped up somewhere.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760540321"
            ]
          },
          "760540321": {
            "id": "760540321",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You have a wonderful time playing the game with Columbina..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7612103",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761210301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761210301": {
            "id": "761210301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I shall carry on their moonlight..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}